# Vendored FFmpeg binaries

This directory contains vendored FFmpeg prebuilt binaries for cross-compilation targets.
Binaries are downloaded by build.rs and gitignored to avoid bloating the repository.

Layout:
```
vendor/
  linux-x86_64/          # Host for box tests
    ffmpeg
    ffprobe
  android-arm64/         # aarch64-linux-android
    ffmpeg
    ffprobe
  android-arm/           # armv7-linux-androideabi
    ffmpeg
    ffprobe
  android-x86_64/        # x86_64-linux-android
    ffmpeg
    ffprobe
  windows-x86_64/        # x86_64-pc-windows-msvc
    ffmpeg.exe
    ffprobe.exe
```

See build.rs for download URLs and checksums.
